# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context for the backend image (production-deploy checklist §2.7).
#
# Rule: the image contains the code it runs and nothing else. Every excluded
# path below is either a secret, someone's local state, or material that turns
# an image pull into a source disclosure.
#
# DO NOT EXCLUDE THESE — the build breaks without them, and both failures were
# reproduced from CI, not guessed:
#   * package.json + yarn.lock at the context root
#   * apps/web/package.json and apps/backend/package.json
#     (`yarn install --frozen-lockfile` resolves the whole workspace graph, so
#     every workspace manifest is required even when only one is built)
#   * apps/backend/src, apps/backend/tsconfig.json, migrations/
#
# Verify after building:
#   docker build -f apps/backend/Dockerfile .
#   docker history --no-trunc <image>          # no secrets in any layer
#   trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL <image>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Version control: the whole history is a source disclosure and often holds
# secrets that were deleted from the working tree (§1.2).
.git
.gitignore
.githooks

# Secrets and local environment (§1.3.1). The payer keypair is mounted at run
# time; it must never be baked into a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/keys/
**/keys/**
**/*-keypair.json
**/id.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/secrets/
**/secrets/**

# Dependencies and build output: reinstalled inside the image from the lockfile;
# dist/ is produced by the build stage.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/build
**/coverage
.anchor
test-ledger
security-reports

# Tests. The backend tsconfig is `include: ["src"]` with `rootDir: src`, so
# removing tests does not break `yarn workspace backend build`.
tests
apps/backend/tests
apps/web/tests

# Frontend source is not needed to build the backend — but the workspace
# manifest IS (see the note at the top). Exclude the tree, keep package.json.
apps/web/src
apps/web/public
apps/web/index.html
apps/web/vite.config.ts
apps/web/check-devnet.js

# Documentation and internal reports.
docs
apps/backend/docs
apps/web/docs
scripts/devnet-legacy

# Local tooling noise.
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
